---
import Icon from '../shared/Icon.astro'
---

<section id="about" class="mb-14 scroll-mt-8 md:mb-22">
  <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5">
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm leading-4 font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap text-neutral-400">
      <Icon class="size-4 " name="list-checks" />
      How I work
    </p>
    <div class="h-px w-full bg-neutral-700"></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl leading-tight font-bold text-neutral-50">
    Useful software starts with understanding the work.
  </h2>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-neutral-400">
    <p>
      I begin by learning how people currently work, where time is lost, and what a successful outcome looks like. That
      context helps me turn requirements into focused product decisions instead of simply reproducing a difficult
      process in software.
    </p>
    <p>
      I can contribute inside an engineering team or own delivery across the stack. My core toolkit includes `Angular`,
      `NestJS`, `TypeScript`, `Docker`, and `CI/CD`, with experience spanning interface development, `APIs`, `databases`,
      `deployment`, and production operations.
    </p>
    <p>
      Much of my work has supported businesses, NGOs, and innovation programs, where dependable systems and clear
      workflows matter. The same practical approach applies to teams in other industries facing complex operational
      problems.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
